cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this work, please cite it as below."
title: "CAR-T-BCMA-QSP: a mechanistic QSP model of BCMA-directed CAR-T in multiple myeloma"
abstract: >-
  A six-state mechanistic quantitative systems pharmacology (QSP) model of
  BCMA-directed CAR-T therapy in multiple myeloma, capturing antigen-stratified
  tumor kill, soluble-BCMA competition, and lymphodepletion-niche dynamics. The
  model is implemented independently in R (rxode2) and Julia
  (DifferentialEquations.jl) and cross-validated to machine precision, with
  identifiability and global sensitivity analysis and an nlmixr2 population
  model. Parameters are illustrative and literature-anchored, not fitted clinical
  estimates.
type: software
